我跟你说过很多次了
...and I keep telling you,

356
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:40,960
可是感觉你从来没听进去
but it's like you're not hearing me!

357
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:44,500
真听不到  等等  先别说
I'm not. Wait, don't talk yet.

358
00:12:45,780 --> 00:12:46,660
现在  快说
Go now, quick!

359
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:47,960
别再装作我不止如此
Stop acting like I'm someone I'm not!

360
00:12:48,072 --> 00:12:49,754
别再我明明没那么好  却猛称赞我
Stop telling me how great I am when it's not true!

361
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:51,280
你看不出这样会给我造成很大压力吗
Don't you see how much pressure that is?!

362
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:53,220
卢克  不许你转身离我...
Luke, don't you walk away from --

363
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:54,820
而去
...me!

364
00:12:57,613 --> 00:12:57,710
我可是你...
I'm your --

365
00:12:58,146 --> 00:12:58,828
你怎么可能36岁啊
How are you 36?

366
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,680
脑子里一直在想你看起来超年轻
I just can't get over how young you look.

367
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:03,740
诀窍就是别笑太大
The trick is to not smile too hard.

368
00:13:03,740 --> 00:13:05,700
你真有意思
You're funny.

369
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:08,240
我真没想到地震学家也能这么有趣
I did not expect that from a seismologist.

370
00:13:08,991 --> 00:13:10,441
说到这里  你是怎么进入这行的啊
Which, by the way, how did you get into that?

371
00:13:10,461 --> 00:13:14,190
天赋异禀  老天爷赏饭吃吧
Oh, um, it's just always come easy for me.

372
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,600
就是我只要扫一眼别人
You know? I look at people

373
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,900
很直觉就能知道她们的尺码
and I just instinctively know their size.

374
00:13:18,109 --> 00:13:19,825
比如人家说"我衣服穿4号"
People are like, "Oh, I'm a 4,"

375
00:13:20,087 --> 00:13:21,298
我就会说"少来了  胖妹
and I'm like, "Who you foolin', girl?

376
00:13:21,308 --> 00:13:21,934
你穿10号"
You a 10."

377
00:13:21,944 --> 00:13:24,301
女士  这是您要的纸巾
Ma'am, here is that napkin you asked for.

378
00:13:24,503 --> 00:13:24,845
谢谢
Oh, thanks.

379
00:13:24,980 --> 00:13:26,340
哈哈  骗到你了吧
Ha ha. Fooled you.

380
00:13:26,340 --> 00:13:28,560
刚才衣服的事情就是开玩笑
I was just joking about clothing stuff.

381
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:32,160
我真正开始学习地震的原因呢
The real reason why I got into studying earthquakes

382
00:13:32,268 --> 00:13:34,325
是因为我热爱大自然
is because I love nature.

383
00:13:34,345 --> 00:13:37,003
所以也难怪你对禽学也有兴趣了吧
I guess that would explain the ornithology interest, too, huh?

384
00:13:37,450 --> 00:13:38,469
小姐  能再给我递张...
Miss, could I have another...

385
00:13:38,971 --> 00:13:41,600
好啦  好啦  好啦
Um, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

386
00:13:41,841 --> 00:13:45,013
天使一直都是超酷的东西嘛
Angels have always been cool,

387
00:13:45,094 --> 00:13:48,147
但是再酷也没鸟类酷
but not as cool as birds!

388
00:13:48,180 --> 00:13:50,080
我超爱鸟类
I love birds!

389
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:52,760
我爱我妈妈啊  真的
I mean, I love my mother, I do,

390
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:55,500
可是她这人自我中心  不考虑他人感受
but it's like her needs come before everyone else's.

391
00:13:55,500 --> 00:13:56,540
你认识这样的人吗
You know that kind of person?

392
00:13:56,540 --> 00:13:58,360
我好像真有认识呢
I think I do, yeah.

393
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,920
等等  为啥我开始聊起我妈了
Wait, why was I talking about her?

394
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:01,280
不知道啊  我本来是问
I don't know. The question was --

395
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:02,400
"你昨晚做什么了"
"What did you do last night?"

396
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:04,080
这问题我还在等你回答
And the question stands.

397
00:14:05,495 --> 00:14:06,414
抱歉
Sorry.

398
00:14:08,707 --> 00:14:09,349
我前夫
Ex-husband.

399
00:14:10,233 --> 00:14:12,163
他就不能跟我儿子共处超过三小时
Honestly, it's like he can't be with my son

400
00:14:12,183 --> 00:14:15,514
并且不问我一些没意义的愚蠢问题吗
for more than three hours without texting me some inane question.

401
00:14:15,534 --> 00:14:16,922
原来你有个儿子啊
Oh -- Oh, you have a son?

402
00:14:17,340 --> 00:14:21,360
我的一生挚爱
Love of my life.

403
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:25,180
离婚这事对他打击挺大
He took the divorce pretty hard.

404
00:14:25,180 --> 00:14:27,960
他比较特别  你懂吗
He's...different, you know?

405
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:28,640
他比较...
He's really --

406
00:14:28,640 --> 00:14:31,260
他很有创意  内心敏感
He's creative and sensitive,

407
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:35,700
在学校常常受欺负
and he gets picked on a lot at school.

408
00:14:35,700 --> 00:14:39,200
真是幸好有他的舞蹈班
You know, it's like, thank God for his dance class.

409
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:41,100
感觉那里好像是唯一
I feel like it's the only place

410
00:14:41,123 --> 00:14:42,932
我能看到他感到真正开心的地方
that I see, like, real joy on his face.

411
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,520
我就知道
I knew it.

412
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:47,800
你就是个大烂人
You're the worst!

413
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:48,840
你说什么
Excuse me?

414
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,340
我不是理查德  你个白痴
I'm not Richard, you fool.

415
00:14:50,340 --> 00:14:52,460
我是被你跟你的大平板
I'm the father you and your giant iPad

416
00:14:52,460 --> 00:14:54,600
夺走自己女儿初次芭蕾独舞的父亲
robbed of his daughter's first ballet solo.

417
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:56,740
我本来期望你有个
I hope whatever reason you had

418
00:14:56,740 --> 00:15:00,200
很好的理由才把自己孩子放在我孩子之上
to prioritize your child over mine was a good one,

419
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,700
而现在我听到理由  虽然挺有理
and now that I hear it, it's pretty close,

420
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:03,900
这我承认  但你还是烂
I have to admit, but still.

421
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:06,920
你真是个神经病
You're a maniac,

422
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:08,380
但我挺庆幸的
but I'm grateful

423
00:15:08,380 --> 00:15:11,620
因为这是我一生中所去过
because this has been one of the most abysmal dates

424
00:15:11,868 --> 00:15:12,513
最烂的约会之一了
I have ever been on.

425
00:15:12,554 --> 00:15:15,017
大多数人觉得猫咪都很冷淡
People think that cats are standoffish,

426
00:15:15,078 --> 00:15:15,967
但我家的这只  每当我回家时...
but my guy, when I come home --

427
00:15:16,331 --> 00:15:17,642
好了  我得请你暂停一下了
Okay, I've got to stop you right there.

428
00:15:17,682 --> 00:15:20,679
我其实不是安娜  我们之间也不来电
I'm not Ana, and this isn't happening.

429
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,940
我感觉到了
I had a feeling.

430
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:25,200
我能起码跟你合个影吗
Can I at least take a picture with you

431
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,540
这样我能跟其他女人说我跟你约会过
so I can tell other women we dated?

432
00:15:26,540 --> 00:15:27,720
什么  不行
What? No!

433
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:28,840
你说得对
You're right.

434
00:15:29,887 --> 00:15:30,852
只是因为你真的超漂亮
It's just that you're so pretty.

435
00:15:30,892 --> 00:15:34,248
好啦  过来拍一张吧
All right, get in here.

436
00:15:34,258 --> 00:15:35,187
小姐
Ma'am?

437
00:15:35,736 --> 00:15:36,770
曼尼  别这样
Manny, come on.

438
00:15:36,780 --> 00:15:38,540
我们去派对要迟到了
We're going to be late for the mixer.

439
00:15:39,045 --> 00:15:40,702
不好意思  我让你从冷板凳起来了吗
Excuse me, did I say your time-out was over?

440
00:15:40,780 --> 00:15:41,740
回你床上去
Back on the bed.

441
00:15:42,253 --> 00:15:44,206
对不起嘛  再也不整你了
I'm sorry, okay? No more pranks.

442
00:15:44,307 --> 00:15:45,132
我发誓
I promise.

443
00:15:45,460 --> 00:15:48,400
我就是想跟你玩一下嘛  真是的
I just wanted to have fun with you. Geez!

444
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:54,060
我忘了我在里面动了手脚
I forgot I did that one!

445
00:15:56,629 --> 00:15:56,650
曼尼  对不起嘛
Aye, Manny! Por favor!

446
00:15:56,660 --> 00:15:56,664
出去  你给我出去
Get out. Get out!

447
00:15:56,674 --> 00:15:58,019
