Luke, we should talk about this!

448
00:15:58,099 --> 00:15:58,883
没什么好谈的
There's nothing to talk about.

449
00:15:59,124 --> 00:16:00,513
你也别想来这个白痴的派对
And you're not coming to this stupid party.

450
00:16:00,553 --> 00:16:01,801
-我要自己去  -我也是
- I'm going alone. - So am I.

451
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:06,380
我才不想去上什么傻逼钟琴课
Like I want to take some stupid bell class

452
00:16:06,380 --> 00:16:08,380
只为了发掘另一个我不擅长的领域
so we can all find out there's one more thing I can't do.

453
00:16:08,380 --> 00:16:10,140
别说了  至少你爸对你有信心
Oh, boo-hoo. Your dad believes in you.

454
00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:12,900
我妈把我当日本整人节目的来宾一样
My mom's treating me like I'm on some Japanese game show.

455
00:16:12,900 --> 00:16:14,640
好  你赢
Fine! You win!

456
00:16:15,029 --> 00:16:17,065
比爸妈差劲你赢  比考大学你赢
You win worst parent, you win college.

457
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:19,300
祝你万事都赢  我就去地下铲屎处
Hope you have fun here while I'm shoveling poo

458
00:16:19,300 --> 00:16:21,160
铲屎就好啦
in some underground poo-shoveling place.

459
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,240
如果你确信自己考不上
Well, why'd you even come here

460
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:23,500
为什么还要来呢
if you're so sure you can't get in?

461
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:24,360
我也不知道
I don't know.

462
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:26,760
大概这是唯一一个我们都能考上的地方
Maybe because this is the one place we might both get in.

463
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:28,600
和你一起  大学才不会那么可怕
That might make this whole thing a little less scary!

464
00:16:28,766 --> 00:16:30,085
我也是因为这样才报名这里啊
Well, that's the only reason I applied, too!

465
00:16:30,368 --> 00:16:31,907
-那我们还吵什么  -我哪知道
-Then why are we fighting?! -I don't know!

466
00:16:31,927 --> 00:16:33,030
那我们还去派对吗
So, are we still going to the party?

467
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:36,783
去啊  等我戴个帽子
Yeah, I'll put on a hat!

468
00:16:36,803 --> 00:16:38,815
我只想让卢克对自己有点自信
I just wanted Luke to feel good about himself, you know?

469
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:40,480
想给他加加油而已
Cheer him on a little.

470
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:43,180
大概过分鼓励也不好
Maybe there is such a thing as too much cheerleading.

471
00:16:43,180 --> 00:16:46,220
如果你总是说有多相信他
You tell him he can do anything, and when he can't,

472
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:47,960
那他一旦失败  就会觉得令你失望了
he feels like he's disappointing you.

473
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:50,260
卢克知道我永远不会对他失望
Luke knows I'd never be disappointed in him.

474
00:16:50,401 --> 00:16:52,277
是吗  卢克是很贴心
Does he? Luke is very sweet,

475
00:16:52,357 --> 00:16:54,036
但也不是总那么灵光啊
but he doesn't know a lot of things.

476
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:55,440
所以我应该适当鼓励他
So I'm supposed to pump him up,

477
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:57,540
但不要过度鼓励以致他会担心令我失望
but not so much that he's afraid to let me down.

478
00:16:57,540 --> 00:16:59,660
我做不好这件事也挺讽刺的
It's ironic that I'm struggling with this

479
00:16:59,660 --> 00:17:01,860
因为我最厉害的拉拉队招式就是"穿针引线"
since my greatest cheerleading move was threading the needle.

480
00:17:01,860 --> 00:17:05,080
就是7名拉拉队队员这么圈起手臂
It's when your seven cheermates make hoop arms --

481
00:17:05,213 --> 00:17:05,676
不想听
I don't care.

482
00:17:05,717 --> 00:17:08,761
我只想让曼尼能开得起玩笑
I just want Manny to learn how to take a joke.

483
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:12,080
但大喊"变态"然后把他
Yes, but there's a difference between a joke

484
00:17:12,080 --> 00:17:13,940
他推进女更衣室还是跟
and yelling "Pervert!" before shoving him

485
00:17:13,940 --> 00:17:14,960
普通开玩笑有差别的
into the girls' locker room.

486
00:17:15,241 --> 00:17:16,311
多好玩啊
Aye, please, that was funny.

487
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:18,100
而且我这么挡著不让他出来时
Besides, I was the one who broke a heel

488
00:17:18,100 --> 00:17:19,800
还把鞋跟弄坏了呢
trying to keep the door shut.

489
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:21,720
大学是人生中的重大改变
College is a big change.

490
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,780
我只想让他轻松应对
I'm just trying to keep it light for him.

491
00:17:23,780 --> 00:17:26,940
是为了他还是为了你自己
For him or for you?

492
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:28,020
好啦
Okay.

493
00:17:28,020 --> 00:17:31,400
这是他人生中第一次离开我
He's leaving me for the first time in his life.

494
00:17:31,939 --> 00:17:33,451
我在婚姻中浮浮沉沉
I've been married, I've been divorced,

495
00:17:33,915 --> 00:17:35,366
也曾不停搬家
I've lived here, I've lived there.

496
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:38,540
我开过出租车  也赢过"星探"节目
I drove a taxi, I won "Star Search."

497
00:17:38,540 --> 00:17:42,520
经历过的所有变化  曼尼一直在我身边
Through all the changes in my life, there was always us.

498
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:43,900
像我的搭档
Like partners.

499
00:17:45,149 --> 00:17:48,207
如果不保持搞笑的气氛  我会很难过的
If I don't keep this light, I am going to be very sad.

500
00:17:48,227 --> 00:17:50,781
我知道  这不好受
I know. It stinks.

501
00:17:52,250 --> 00:17:54,050
只能祈祷年底时  孩子会把你烦得不行
You just have to hope they get irritating enough

502
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:56,099
你就能开心地送他走了
by the end of the year that you're ready for them to go.

503
00:17:56,700 --> 00:17:59,420
那我应该把口琴还给他
Maybe I should give him his harmonica back.

504
00:17:59,420 --> 00:18:01,380
这么想就对了
That's the spirit.

505
00:18:02,645 --> 00:18:04,234
你吃我这半块牛肉
Here, take my half steak.

506
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:05,800
我吃你半条鱼
I'll take half your fish.

507
00:18:06,127 --> 00:18:08,022
我偶尔得骗骗我的动脉
I got to trick my arteries every once in a while,

508
00:18:08,042 --> 00:18:09,293
不然他们又要造反了
keep them on their toes.

509
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:11,030
虽然我不知道你最近在练什么
Well, I don't know what you're doing,

510
00:18:11,090 --> 00:18:11,879
但你状态看起来很棒
but you look great.

511
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:13,780
你气色也不错
And you look great, too.

512
00:18:13,780 --> 00:18:15,160
吧台那里有个空位
Oh, look, there's no line at the bar.

513
00:18:15,234 --> 00:18:16,608
看在往日情分去喝杯鸡尾酒如何
How about a Rob Roy for old time's sake?

514
00:18:16,900 --> 00:18:19,560
中士  你还记得呢
Oh, you remembered, Sarge.

515
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:22,960
这是我怀孕时唯一喝了不会吐的酒
That was the only drink I could keep down when I was pregnant.

516
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:25,700
他们俩怎么了
Who are those people?

517
00:18:25,875 --> 00:18:27,607
你听到了  他们是"中士"与"小豆宝"
You heard them. They're "Sarge" and "Pea."

518
00:18:28,534 --> 00:18:30,551
我从没听他们这样称呼对方
Two nicknames I have never heard in my entire life.

519
00:18:30,794 --> 00:18:32,530
我才不信他们俩能这么和谐
This kindness, I don't trust it.

520
00:18:32,550 --> 00:18:35,070
-我懂  暴风雨前的宁静  -对
-I know, it's like a purple sky before a storm.  -Exactly.

521
00:18:35,110 --> 00:18:39,118
美丽宁静  直到你发现鸟儿们惶恐不安
Beautiful, until you realize the birds are agitated

522
00:18:39,138 --> 00:18:40,612
蚂蚁也围成了一个圈
and ants are walking in circles.

523
00:18:40,780 --> 00:18:41,560
那什么
Actually, you know what?

524
00:18:42,208 --> 00:18:43,704
我胃不太舒服
My -- My stomach's feeling a little weird.

525
00:18:43,724 --> 00:18:45,510
我得去走走  呼吸下新鲜空气
I think I'm gonna take a walk, get a little fresh air.

526
00:18:45,611 --> 00:18:46,362
不准走
Oh, no. You don't --

527
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:48,200
这次我绝对不会让你跑了
You are not running away this time. No.

528
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,300
放开我  霸道鬼
Let go, bossy!

529
00:18:49,434 --> 00:18:51,817
给我坐下  家人有罪一起受
Sit down. We are gonna suffer like a family!

530
00:18:52,161 --> 00:18:53,534
别抓我  你别拉我的外套
No. Don't -- Don't stretch out my jacket!

531
00:18:53,554 --> 00:18:57,697
我刚减肥到可以穿贴身版的
I just got back into slim fit!

532
00:18:57,717 --> 00:18:58,742
-还好吗  -没事没事
-Is everything all right? -Yeah.

533
00:18:58,752 --> 00:18:58,926
-他没事的  -我只是...
-He's fine. -I just --

534
00:18:58,984 --> 00:19:01,817
是啊  亲爹如你  怎么会关心我呢
Oh, no, of course. Yeah, go get that.

535
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:03,280
这是怎么了
What's going on?

536
00:19:03,650 --> 00:19:04,697
-没什么啦  -她推的我
-Oh... -She pushed me.

537
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:05,440
我没推他
I didn't push him.

538
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:07,300
他只是日常滑倒
He just, you know, slipped, fell.

539
00:19:07,300 --> 00:19:09,940
坐下  你们俩怎么这么多戏
Sit down, sit down. You're causing a scene.

540
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:11,220
太丢人了
It's very embarrassing.

541
00:19:11,760 --> 00:19:13,720
大小姐  你今天脾气很爆啊
You have been quite rude today, young lady.

542
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:15,440
跟巴顿将军有一拼
General Patton over there.

543
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:18,140
而你  就只会像布景一样傻坐著
And this one is basically a cardboard cutout

544
00:19:18,175 --> 00:19:20,416
偶尔喝口酒  叹声气
who occasionally sip wine and sighs.

545
00:19:20,578 --> 00:19:22,894
我们可没教育你们成为这样的人
We did not raise you to act like this.

546
00:19:22,934 --> 00:19:25,029
-恕我直言  -让我来唱这个红脸
-Oh, excuse me. -No, I-I got it.

547
00:19:25,140 --> 00:19:29,240
你们一直就是这样言传身教的好吗
No, in fact, you raised us to act exactly like this, okay?

548
00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:31,140
你们俩才是今天发神经病的人
You two are the ones that are acting crazy.

549
00:19:31,140 --> 00:19:32,700
你在说什么
What are you talking about?

550
00:19:32,851 --> 00:19:33,659
中士和小豆宝是谁啊
Who the hell are Sarge and Pea,

551
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:36,880
我们成长时怎么没见过这对神仙眷侣呢
and where were they when we were growing up?

552
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:38,780
如果是他们俩教养我们长大
Yeah, maybe if those two people had raised us,

553
00:19:38,780 --> 00:19:40,020
那么家里也不会
there would have been room in our house

554
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:41,680
容不下有血有肉有感情的人
for other people to have emotions

555
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:44,860
某人就不用搞自闭  封闭感情了
and somebody wouldn't have had to shut himself down.

556
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:48,360
某人也不会总想著要
And maybe somebody wouldn't be trying

557
00:19:48,360 --> 00:19:49,260
掌控全世界了
to control the whole world

558
00:19:49,260 --> 00:19:50,540
全因为她长大的期间
because she couldn't control the chaos

559
00:19:50,540 --> 00:19:52,480
她控制不了家中的混乱
in her own home growing up.

560
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,280
干嘛
Oh, come on.

561
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:54,660
我们谁不清楚她的问题在哪
We all know that's what's wrong with her.

562
00:19:55,651 --> 00:19:56,538
-天  -所以
- Oh, God. - So, come on.

563
00:19:56,600 --> 00:19:57,940
你们是不是还欠我们个解释
What do you have to say for yourselves?

564
00:19:57,940 --> 00:20:00,320
-你说的一点没错  -我也承认
- Well, you're not wrong. - True.

565
00:20:00,500 --> 00:20:02,267
-你说什么  -我没听错吧
- I'm -- I'm sorry. One more time. - What?

566
00:20:02,277 --> 00:20:05,374
我们没离婚时  是做得不够好
We didn't behave well when we were married,

567
00:20:05,380 --> 00:20:08,320
我也很内疚
and I feel bad about that.

568
00:20:08,320 --> 00:20:09,080
我也是
Me too.

569
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:11,220
我们自以为硬不离婚是为了你们
We thought we were staying together for you,

570
00:20:11,293 --> 00:20:13,757
但或许我们逼著你们
but I don't know, maybe we'd forced you

571
00:20:13,760 --> 00:20:15,940
跟两个并不快乐的人相处了太久
to live with two unhappy people for too long.

572
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:17,980
但我们现在都很幸福
But we're happy now.

573
00:20:18,874 --> 00:20:22,768
或许也因此  我们今天才能做最本来的自己
And that's probably why we're able to be our old selves today.

574
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:24,600
这些话我们早就该说
We should have said this a long time ago,

575
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:26,680
没能给你们一个美满的家庭
but we didn't give you the kind of home you deserved,

576
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:29,100
我们真的很抱歉
and for that, we're sorry.

577
00:20:30,256 --> 00:20:31,325
你们不必这样
Well, you -- I mean, there was --

578
00:20:31,446 --> 00:20:32,515
我们也有过幸福的时刻啊
There was happy times, too.

579
00:20:32,535 --> 00:20:33,341
对啊  也不是一直都很疯癫
Yeah, no, it wasn't all crazytown.

580
00:20:34,247 --> 00:20:34,468
-也有开心的时候  -是啊
- It was... - Yeah.

581
00:20:34,700 --> 00:20:37,440
听
Listen.

582
00:20:38,151 --> 00:20:38,976
话都说开了  我们能去跳舞了吗
We're good, right? We can go?

583
00:20:38,986 --> 00:20:39,943
-去吧  -当然
Yes. Of course.

584
00:20:43,660 --> 00:20:45,280
真没想到
Wow. How about that?

585
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:46,680
他们居然道歉了
An apology.

586
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:52,020
我从没想过我会如此释然
I don't think I ever thought it would feel so good.

587
00:20:52,020 --> 00:20:56,220
看他们相亲相爱的样子我是很开心的
I do like seeing them happy.

588
00:20:56,250 --> 00:20:56,899
是啊
Yeah.

589
00:20:58,581 --> 00:20:59,293
别哭了
Ohh, you.

590
00:20:59,420 --> 00:21:01,120
你闭嘴
Shut up.

591
00:21:01,120 --> 00:21:03,600
我不像你是机器人
I feel stuff.

592
00:21:04,425 --> 00:21:04,914
我懂啦
I know.

593
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:13,960
天啊  太牛了
Son of a bitch! That is coconuts!

594
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,720
我还记得你呢
I remember you!

595
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,660
你怀念当模特代言人的时光吗
Do you miss spokesmodeling?

596
00:21:23,999 --> 00:21:25,735
我现在还偶尔做个帆船博览会呢
Aye, I do a boat show every now and then.

597
00:21:25,800 --> 00:21:27,540
我是这么保持还在业界活动的
That's how I keep my hand in it.

598
00:21:27,540 --> 00:21:28,600
快看
Watch, watch.

599
00:21:28,600 --> 00:21:31,540
这是我的绝杀招数
This is how I sealed the deal.

600
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,760
又有一个你
It's you again.
